    <item>
      <title>当算力成为新货币：Meta的“黄牛”生意经</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/meta-20260706211009131-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 21:10:09 +0800</pubDate>
